t self, n: usize) -> Vec<u8> {\n        (0..n).map(|_| self.next_u8()).collect()\n    }\n}\n\n/// The canonical fixed seed used by every randomized row.\npub const SEED: u64 = 0x2545_F491_4F6C_DD1D;\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false}}
